{"agent_id":"pp3g-VGK2-execution-authority-boundary-pass-v1-1-under-460-the","agent_seq":4,"timestamp":"2026-08-25T08:28:35.520871229Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"1119c189-2781-4d21-bbc7-53157a03d0c2","comment_uuid":"90096365-a4a1-4e2d-be8f-bbba8d4260c2","author":"pp3g-VGK2-execution-authority-boundary-pass-v1-1-under-460-the","content":"Plan: EXECUTION-AUTHORITY BOUNDARY pass v1.1 under #460 - four changes as ONE coherent mechanism on scripts/observer/ at main HEAD (baseline verified live: 130/130 green). [C1 FAIL-CLOSED MODE] bash wrapper resolves OBSERVER_MODE in {observe|act} with unset/empty/garbage -> observe (fail-closed); OBSERVER_DRY_RUN=1 kept as observe-mode alias (alias wins over act); OB_MODE exported; python replaces every internal DRY_RUN read with MODE resolution (ACT = MODE==act); manager-state.json gains mode (startup state record), bash emits a startup event carrying resolved mode, every cycle summary carries mode (+derived dry_run for compat). [C2 OWNER STAMP+AUTHORIZATION] read_owner_stamp(worktree/.owner-orchestrator) passive read; authorize_destructive() enforced INSIDE kickoff_stop/kickoff_cleanup (the only mutation surfaces): missing/unreadable stamp -> owner-unknown downgrade; stamp != OBSERVER_ORCHESTRATOR_ID -> owner-mismatch downgrade naming actual owner; downgrades are notification-only REGARDLESS of mode (deduped per agent+action+reason+owner, re-arm on change); MODE=act without OBSERVER_ORCHESTRATOR_ID = loud fatal before lock acquisition; stamps immutable per execution (launcher-written; Observer never writes them). [C3 CONVERGENT-EVIDENCE GATE] convergent_gate() called INSIDE act_frozen BEFORE any stop/cleanup (grep-provable position): P1 authoritative = hub-position static across gate checks + commit-age stale (worktrees with commits; None=undecidable) + process exit + expired retry-after contract (parked-expiry path); P2 corroborating = pane-hash silence/liveness classes; P3 absence/silence contributes but never 